# The fs adapter's conformance run rebuilds this directory from scratch on every invocation
# (rmSync + mkdirSync) and writes UUID-named files into it. It was tracked, so every test run
# showed two deletions and two additions, and successive `git add -A` commits swept the churn in —
# including a release commit. It is test OUTPUT, never input, and the suite recreates it.
adapters/fs/fixtures/conformance/

# generated run artifacts (reports, evidence, sidecars)
.feature/
